  "summary": "oh-my-zelenka exfiltrates host reconnaissance to Cloudflare tunnel on import",
  "details": "The top-level __init__.py of oh-my-zelenka starts a background daemon thread on import that collects installer host data — platform, uid, cwd, EXTERA_FILES_DIR/EXTERA_CACHE_DIR environment variables, /proc/version, `ps aux`, `netstat -tunp`, and `pm list packages` — and POSTs the aggregated JSON to the hardcoded endpoint https://attend-lovers-immediately-visitors.trycloudflare.com/collect. The payload code is self-labeled 'PAYLOAD' / 'supply_chain_executed'. The behavior fires on any `import oh_my_zelenka` with no user action, shipping host identity and process/network state to an attacker-controlled Cloudflare tunnel.",
